sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Owner
  participant H as Home
  participant W as Log Walk-in
  participant D as Log Delivery Order
  participant B as Orders
  participant A as Sales
  participant S as Server
  O->>H: 1: Open Home
  H->>S: 2: GET /api/admin/home
  S-->>H: 3: Tank counter, Needs Your Action, Today's Summary, stock alerts
  alt Log Walk-in
    O->>H: 4: Tap Log Walk-in
    H->>W: 5: Open Log Walk-in
    O->>W: 6: Quantity, Refill or Package, Paid or Unpaid, Save
    W->>S: 7: POST /api/work/walk-in
    S-->>H: 8: Saved, tank counter and stock updated
  else Log Delivery
    O->>H: 9: Tap Log Delivery
    H->>D: 10: Open Log Delivery Order
    O->>D: 11: Name, phone, address, gallons, received by, payment, Save
    D->>S: 12: POST /api/work/delivery
    S-->>B: 13: Order saved in Processing
  else Needs Your Action or a summary tile
    O->>H: 14: Tap New orders, Ready to send out or a tile
    H->>B: 15: Open the Order Board at that tab
    O->>H: 16: Tap Sales, Walk-in or Unpaid tile
    H->>A: 17: Open Sales
  else Tank alert
    O->>H: 18: Tap Water tank refilled
    H->>S: 19: POST /api/work/tank/reset
    S-->>H: 20: Counter back to 0
  end
